@1540 = ~SadoEE~
@1541 = ~SadoEE features switched on or off in game. Off only stops a feature from acting: what it already did stays.~
@1542 = ~Stash hints: red / blue items~
@1543 = ~Party stash page: unusable items in red, unidentified ones in blue.~
@1544 = ~Stash hints: + upgrade mark~
@1545 = ~Party stash page: a + on items that are an upgrade for the shown character, or a mage scroll a party member can still learn.~
@1546 = ~DPS line in weapon tooltips~
@1547 = ~Damage per round and THAC0 of the equipped weapons, added to their tooltips.~
@1548 = ~Passive trap detection~
