@1553 = ~A click on a trapped or locked container sends the best disarmer, lockpicker or basher.~
@1554 = ~Gold outline on valuable containers~
@1555 = ~Containers holding something valuable get a gold outline.~
@1556 = ~Endless ammo~
@1557 = ~Arrows, bolts, bullets, darts and throwing weapons are never used up, except the most powerful ones.~
