@1592 = ~Open the SadoEE options page~
@1593 = ~The SadoEE switches and mouse buttons have their own page: also in the game's Options menu (Esc) and from Decard at the camp.~
@1594 = ~I'd like to change a few habits of the party.~
@1595 = ~Of course. Here is how things stand.~
@1596 = ~Point at a line to read about it.~
@1597 = ~Click: choose the action. Right click: nothing. MMO mouse side buttons send keys: bind them in the game's Keybindings.~
@1600 = ~NPC pairs can separate: sending one away no longer sends the other one too (Jaheira and Khalid, Minsc and Dynaheir, Xzar and Montaron, Eldoth and Skie)~
@1601 = ~This component is for Baldur's Gate (BGEE) and EET.~
